From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:14:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: add fork PR gates for staging4

Adds the Compose PR matrix (JVM/Web suites, iOS renderer fixtures and
warnings-as-errors build, OHOS arm64 link, source-contract checkers) and the
checker/harness files it runs, re-keyed to staging4. The single-commit
identity gate becomes a patch-queue gate: every commit must be DCO signed
off by its committer, history must be linear on the current staging4 tip,
and a series drift step runs raft-patches/verify.sh once it exists.
The layout-size checks move here from the dropped staging3 migration gate;
the profiler observer-state checker is left out with its deferred feature.

Fork-Patch: ci-fork-pr-gates
